<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Vīlla Mystēriōrum · A Glossomathia Latin Escape Room</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --purple:#8E7CC3; --purple-mid:#a88bcf; --purple-deep:#6d5b87; --purple-bg:#f7eef9;
    --blue:#7aa6b9; --blue-mid:#5e95ab; --blue-deep:#3f6d82; --blue-bg:#e9f1f7;
    --green:#6fae84; --green-mid:#5a9670; --green-deep:#3f7a54; --green-bg:#eaf6ee;
    --rose:#c98bb0; --rose-mid:#b87aa0; --rose-deep:#9c5980; --rose-bg:#fbeef5;
    --plum:#4a4458; --lav:#ece3f7; --lav-pale:#f7f2fc; --gold:#c9a86a;
    --ink:#4a4458;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  body{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; color:var(--ink);
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f2fc 0%, #f7eef9 35%, #e9f1f7 70%, #eaf6ee 100%);
    min-height:100vh; padding:24px 14px 60px;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;}
  h1,h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3.2rem); font-weight:700; color:var(--purple-deep); text-align:center; line-height:1.1;}
  .subtitle{text-align:center; color:var(--purple-mid); font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:.78rem; margin-top:8px;}

  /* top bar */
  .hud{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    background:#ffffffcc; backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
    border:2px solid var(--lav); border-radius:18px; padding:10px 16px; margin:20px 0 18px;
    position:sticky; top:8px; z-index:5;
  }
  .hud .timer{font-weight:800; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--purple-deep); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .keys{display:flex; gap:6px; font-size:1.05rem;}
  .keyslot{width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--lav-pale); border:2px dashed #cbbfe6;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:700; color:var(--purple-deep);}
  .keyslot.filled{border-style:solid; background:#fff;}
  .progress-track{height:8px; background:var(--lav-pale); border-radius:99px; overflow:hidden; flex:1;}
  .progress-fill{height:100%; width:0%; border-radius:99px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--purple),var(--blue),var(--green),var(--rose)); transition:width .5s ease;}

  .card{
    background:#fff; border-radius:24px; padding:28px 26px 26px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(142,124,195,.14); border:2px solid var(--lav);
    animation:pop .35s ease;
  }
  @keyframes pop{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} to{opacity:1; transform:none;}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ *{animation:none !important; transition:none !important;} }

  .room-eyebrow{font-size:.75rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .card h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,5vw,2.3rem); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .story{font-size:1rem; line-height:1.65; margin:12px 0 20px; color:#5c5570;}
  .story em{font-style:italic;}

  .q{border-radius:18px; padding:18px 18px 16px; margin-bottom:16px; border:2px solid transparent;}
  .q .qtext{font-weight:700; margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.5;}
  .q .latin{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.25em; font-weight:600;}
  .choices{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr)); gap:10px;}
  button.choice{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:1rem; cursor:pointer;
    background:#fff; border:2px solid #ddd3ef; border-radius:14px; padding:12px 10px; color:var(--ink);
    transition:transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;
  }
  button.choice:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(74,68,88,.12);}
  button.choice:focus-visible, .typein input:focus-visible, .check:focus-visible, .bigbtn:focus-visible, .hintbtn:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--purple); outline-offset:2px;}
  button.choice.correct{background:var(--green-bg); border-color:var(--green); color:var(--green-deep);}
  button.choice.wrong{background:var(--rose-bg); border-color:var(--rose); color:var(--rose-deep); animation:shake .3s;}
  @keyframes shake{25%{transform:translateX(-4px);}75%{transform:translateX(4px);}}

  .typein{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .typein input{
    flex:1; min-width:150px; font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700;
    padding:11px 14px; border-radius:14px; border:2px solid #ddd3ef; color:var(--ink); background:#fff;
  }
  .check{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1rem; cursor:pointer;
    border:none; border-radius:14px; padding:11px 20px; color:#fff;
  }
  .q.solved{border-color:var(--green); background:var(--green-bg) !important;}
  .q.solved .check{opacity:.5; pointer-events:none;}
  .feedback{margin-top:10px; font-weight:700; font-size:.92rem; min-height:1.2em;}
  .feedback.good{color:var(--green-deep);}
  .feedback.bad{color:var(--rose-deep);}

  .hintbtn{background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight:700;
    font-size:.85rem; color:var(--blue-deep); text-decoration:underline dotted; margin-top:8px; padding:2px;}
  .hinttext{display:none; margin-top:8px; font-size:.9rem; background:var(--lav-pale); border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px; color:var(--purple-deep);}
  .hinttext.show{display:block;}

  .doorbox{margin-top:8px; text-align:center; padding:20px; border-radius:18px; background:var(--lav-pale); border:2px dashed #cbbfe6;}
  .doorbox.open{border-style:solid; background:var(--green-bg); border-color:var(--green);}
  .bigbtn{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1.08rem; cursor:pointer;
    border:none; border-radius:16px; padding:14px 30px; color:#fff; background:var(--purple);
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(142,124,195,.35); transition:transform .12s ease;
  }
  .bigbtn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .bigbtn:disabled{background:#cfc6e4; box-shadow:none; cursor:not-allowed; transform:none;}
  .keybanner{
    display:none; margin-top:16px; padding:16px; border-radius:16px; text-align:center;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fdf8ec,#fbf3e0); border:2px solid var(--gold); color:#7a5f2e; font-weight:800;
  }
  .keybanner .numeral{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:2rem; display:block; color:#8a6a2f;}
  .keybanner.show{display:block; animation:pop .4s ease;}

  table.endings{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:6px 0 4px; font-size:.95rem;}
  table.endings th{font-weight:800; padding:7px 9px; text-align:left;}
  table.endings td{padding:7px 9px; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:600;}
  table.endings tr:nth-child(even){background:#ffffff88;}

  .screen{display:none;}
  .screen.active{display:block;}

  /* per-room tints */
  .r1 .room-eyebrow, .r1 h2{color:var(--purple-deep);} .r1 .q{background:var(--purple-bg);} .r1 .check{background:var(--purple);}
  .r2 .room-eyebrow, .r2 h2{color:var(--blue-deep);}   .r2 .q{background:var(--blue-bg);}   .r2 .check{background:var(--blue-mid);}
  .r3 .room-eyebrow, .r3 h2{color:var(--green-deep);}  .r3 .q{background:var(--green-bg);}  .r3 .check{background:var(--green-mid);}
  .r4 .room-eyebrow, .r4 h2{color:var(--rose-deep);}   .r4 .q{background:var(--rose-bg);}   .r4 .check{background:var(--rose-mid);}
  .r5 .room-eyebrow, .r5 h2{color:var(--purple-deep);} .r5 .q{background:var(--lav-pale);}  .r5 .check{background:var(--purple);}

  .final-code{display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; margin:14px 0;}
  .final-code input{
    width:58px; height:64px; text-align:center; font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:800; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    border:2px solid #ddd3ef; border-radius:14px; color:var(--purple-deep); background:#fff;
  }
  .cert{
    text-align:center; padding:34px 24px; border-radius:24px;
    background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f7f2fc,#fbeef5 55%,#eaf6ee); border:3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .cert h2{color:var(--purple-deep); font-size:2.4rem;}
  .cert .laurel{font-size:2.6rem;}
  .cert .time{font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--green-deep); margin:10px 0;}
  .confetti{position:fixed; top:-10px; font-size:1.3rem; animation:fall linear forwards; z-index:50; pointer-events:none;}
  @keyframes fall{to{transform:translateY(105vh) rotate(540deg); opacity:.7;}}

  footer{text-align:center; margin-top:34px; color:#b3a7c9; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.05rem;}

  /* ---------- Bubo the owl ---------- */
  .owl-fixed{
    position:fixed; right:14px; bottom:14px; z-index:40; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .owl-bubble{
    background:#fff; border:2px solid var(--lav); border-radius:16px 16px 4px 16px;
    padding:9px 14px; font-weight:800; font-size:.9rem; color:var(--purple-deep);
    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(142,124,195,.22); margin-bottom:6px; max-width:210px;
    opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px); transition:opacity .25s ease, transform .25s ease;
  }
  .owl-bubble.show{opacity:1; transform:none;}
  .owl-svg{width:74px; height:auto; filter:drop-shadow(0 5px 10px rgba(74,68,88,.2)); animation:bob 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
  @keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-6px);}}
  .owl-svg.happy{animation:owljump .55s ease;}
  @keyframes owljump{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0);}30%{transform:translateY(-16px) rotate(-6deg);}60%{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(6deg);}}
  .cert .owl-svg{width:110px; animation:bob 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;}

  /* ---------- emoji match game ---------- */
  .matchgrid{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;}
  .matchrow{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; justify-content:center;}
  button.mword, button.memoji{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; cursor:pointer; border-radius:14px; border:2px solid #ddd3ef;
    background:#fff; transition:transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;
  }
  button.mword{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:700; padding:9px 16px; color:var(--ink);}
  button.memoji{font-size:1.7rem; padding:7px 13px;}
  button.mword:hover, button.memoji:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(74,68,88,.12);}
  button.mword:focus-visible, button.memoji:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple); outline-offset:2px;}
  button.mword.picked, button.memoji.picked{border-color:var(--purple); background:var(--lav-pale); transform:translateY(-2px);}
  button.mword.matched, button.memoji.matched{
    border-color:var(--green); background:var(--green-bg); color:var(--green-deep);
    pointer-events:none; animation:matchpop .35s ease;
  }
  @keyframes matchpop{40%{transform:scale(1.15);}}
  button.mword.nope, button.memoji.nope{border-color:var(--rose); background:var(--rose-bg); animation:shake .3s;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="owl-fixed" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="owl-bubble" id="owlbubble">Salvē! I am Bubō, guardian of the villa. 🌿</div>
  <svg class="owl-svg" id="owlsvg" viewBox="0 0 120 130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <!-- body -->
    <ellipse cx="60" cy="78" rx="42" ry="46" fill="#b9a68f"/>
    <!-- chest -->
    <ellipse cx="60" cy="90" rx="27" ry="30" fill="#e8ddcf"/>
    <!-- chevron chest feathers -->
    <path d="M46 82 l7 6 7-6" stroke="#c9b8a2" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M60 82 l7 6 7-6" stroke="#c9b8a2" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M53 94 l7 6 7-6" stroke="#c9b8a2" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <!-- wings -->
    <ellipse cx="20" cy="82" rx="12" ry="26" fill="#a08d76" transform="rotate(12 20 82)"/>
    <ellipse cx="100" cy="82" rx="12" ry="26" fill="#a08d76" transform="rotate(-12 100 82)"/>
    <!-- head tufts -->
    <path d="M28 32 q-4-14 8-16 q-2 8 4 12z" fill="#a08d76"/>
    <path d="M92 32 q4-14 -8-16 q2 8 -4 12z" fill="#a08d76"/>
    <!-- head -->
    <circle cx="60" cy="42" r="32" fill="#b9a68f"/>
    <!-- eye discs -->
    <circle cx="47" cy="42" r="14" fill="#fff"/>
    <circle cx="73" cy="42" r="14" fill="#fff"/>
    <!-- navy irises -->
    <circle cx="47" cy="43" r="8" fill="#08314a"/>
    <circle cx="73" cy="43" r="8" fill="#08314a"/>
    <circle cx="50" cy="40" r="2.6" fill="#fff"/>
    <circle cx="76" cy="40" r="2.6" fill="#fff"/>
    <!-- beak -->
    <path d="M60 48 l-6 7 q6 6 12 0z" fill="#e8913c"/>
    <!-- laurel wreath -->
    <path d="M32 26 q10-10 28-11 q18 1 28 11" stroke="#c9a86a" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <ellipse cx="34" cy="24" rx="4" ry="2.4" fill="#c9a86a" transform="rotate(-35 34 24)"/>
    <ellipse cx="44" cy="18.5" rx="4" ry="2.4" fill="#c9a86a" transform="rotate(-20 44 18.5)"/>
    <ellipse cx="86" cy="24" rx="4" ry="2.4" fill="#c9a86a" transform="rotate(35 86 24)"/>
    <ellipse cx="76" cy="18.5" rx="4" ry="2.4" fill="#c9a86a" transform="rotate(20 76 18.5)"/>
    <!-- feet -->
    <path d="M46 122 l-4 6 M46 122 l0 7 M46 122 l4 6" stroke="#e8913c" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M74 122 l-4 6 M74 122 l0 7 M74 122 l4 6" stroke="#e8913c" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  </svg>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Vīlla Mystēriōrum</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">🌿 A Glossomathia Latin Escape Room 🌿</p>

  <div class="hud" id="hud" style="display:none;">
    <div class="timer" id="timer">00:00</div>
    <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="pfill"></div></div>
    <div class="keys">
      <div class="keyslot" id="k1"></div><div class="keyslot" id="k2"></div>
      <div class="keyslot" id="k3"></div><div class="keyslot" id="k4"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="screen active card r1" id="s0">
    <p class="room-eyebrow">Salvē, explōrātrīx!</p>
    <h2>The Villa Has Locked Its Doors…</h2>
    <p class="story">
      You slipped into an ancient Roman villa to admire the mosaics, but at sunset the great bronze doors
      slammed shut behind you. A carved owl above the atrium blinks at you and hoots:
      <em>"Only one who masters the words of the Romans may leave. Pass through my four rooms,
      collect the four numeral keys, and the Porta Magna will open."</em>
      <br><br>
      Solve every puzzle in a room to earn its key. Spelling counts, but you may type long marks or leave
      them out (puellae = puellae). Hints are free, so use them when you are stuck. Good luck! 🌿
    </p>
    <div style="text-align:center;"><button class="bigbtn" onclick="startGame()">Enter the villa</button></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROOM 1: ATRIUM — 1st declension nouns -->
  <section class="screen card r1" id="s1">
    <p class="room-eyebrow">Room I · Ātrium</p>
    <h2>The Hall of the First Declension</h2>
    <p class="story">Water trickles in the impluvium. On the wall, a mosaic of a girl (<span class="latin">puella</span>) holds a jug of water (<span class="latin">aqua</span>). Beneath her, tiles are missing from an endings chart. Restore the words to reveal the first key.</p>

    <div class="q" id="q1a">
      <p class="qtext">1 · The mosaic reads: <span class="latin">"Jug of the girl."</span> Type <span class="latin">puella</span> in the genitive singular ("of the girl").</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="puell…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">The 1st declension genitive singular ending is <b>-ae</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q1b">
      <p class="qtext">2 · A tile shows the girls doing something to the stars. Which form means "the stars" as a direct object (accusative plural)?</p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">stellae</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">stellās</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">stellīs</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">stellārum</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Accusative plural of the 1st declension ends in <b>-ās</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q1c">
      <p class="qtext">3 · Fill the missing tile in the chart. Type the ablative singular of <span class="latin">terra</span> ("by/with the land").</p>
      <table class="endings">
        <tr><th></th><th>Singular</th><th>Plural</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Nom.</td><td>terra</td><td>terrae</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Gen.</td><td>terrae</td><td>terrārum</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Dat.</td><td>terrae</td><td>terrīs</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Acc.</td><td>terram</td><td>terrās</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Abl.</td><td><b>?</b></td><td>terrīs</td></tr>
      </table>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="terr…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Ablative singular is <b>-ā</b> (long a). You may simply type <b>terra</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q1d">
      <p class="qtext">4 · The owl hoots: <em>"Give a gift TO the stars."</em> Type <span class="latin">stella</span> in the dative plural ("to/for the stars").</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="stell…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Dative plural of the 1st declension ends in <b>-īs</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q1e">
      <p class="qtext">5 · 🎨 The floor tiles have scrambled themselves! Tap a Latin word, then tap its picture, and pair them all up again.</p>
      <div class="matchgrid" data-game="m1">
        <div class="matchrow">
          <button class="mword" data-pair="girl">puella</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="water">aqua</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="star">stella</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="rose">rosa</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="earth">terra</button>
        </div>
        <div class="matchrow">
          <button class="memoji" data-pair="star" aria-label="star">⭐</button>
          <button class="memoji" data-pair="earth" aria-label="earth">🌍</button>
          <button class="memoji" data-pair="girl" aria-label="girl">👧</button>
          <button class="memoji" data-pair="rose" aria-label="rose">🌹</button>
          <button class="memoji" data-pair="water" aria-label="water">💧</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="keybanner" id="key1">The mosaic glows! You found the first key: <span class="numeral">V</span></div>
    <div class="doorbox" id="door1">
      <p style="margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:700;">Solve all five puzzles to unlock the library door.</p>
      <button class="bigbtn" disabled onclick="goTo(2)">Open the door →</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROOM 2: BIBLIOTHECA — 2nd declension nouns -->
  <section class="screen card r2" id="s2">
    <p class="room-eyebrow">Room II · Bibliothēca</p>
    <h2>The Library of the Second Declension</h2>
    <p class="story">Scrolls everywhere! A friendly ghost of a Roman scribe appears. <em>"My friend (<span class="latin">amīcus</span>) hid the key inside a scroll about gifts (<span class="latin">dōna</span>) and wars (<span class="latin">bella</span>). Answer my riddles about -us and -um words."</em></p>

    <div class="q" id="q2a">
      <p class="qtext">1 · One of these nouns is neuter (an -um word). Which one?</p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">amīcus</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">puer</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">dōnum</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">ager</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">2nd declension neuters end in <b>-um</b> in the nominative singular.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q2b">
      <p class="qtext">2 · The scroll's title says "Gifts" — many of them! Type the nominative plural of <span class="latin">dōnum</span>.</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="dōn…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Neuter plurals in the nominative and accusative end in <b>-a</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q2c">
      <p class="qtext">3 · The ghost wants to call out to his friend directly: <em>"O friend!"</em> Type the vocative singular of <span class="latin">amīcus</span>.</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="amīc…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">-us words are special: the vocative singular ends in <b>-e</b>. (Think "Et tū, Brūte!")</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q2d">
      <p class="qtext">4 · The last scroll is titled <span class="latin">"Liber Bellōrum"</span> — "The Book ___". What does <span class="latin">bellōrum</span> mean?</p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">to the wars</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">of the wars</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">the wars (subject)</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">with the war</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>-ōrum</b> is the genitive plural ending: "of the ___s".</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="keybanner" id="key2">A scroll unrolls by itself! Second key found: <span class="numeral">III</span></div>
    <div class="doorbox" id="door2">
      <p style="margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:700;">Solve all four riddles to unlock the kitchen door.</p>
      <button class="bigbtn" disabled onclick="goTo(3)">Open the door →</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROOM 3: CULINA — 1st conjugation verbs -->
  <section class="screen card r3" id="s3">
    <p class="room-eyebrow">Room III · Culīna</p>
    <h2>The Kitchen of the First Conjugation</h2>
    <p class="story">Pots bubble on their own! The cook's parrot squawks verbs at you: <em>amō, portō, laudō, vocō!</em> Feed it the right forms of these <b>-āre</b> verbs and it will cough up the key. (Rude, but effective.)</p>

    <div class="q" id="q3a">
      <p class="qtext">1 · Complete the chant the parrot started: <span class="latin">amō, amās, ___</span> (he/she loves).</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="am…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">3rd person singular ends in <b>-t</b>: amō, amās, ama<b>t</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q3b">
      <p class="qtext">2 · You and the parrot lift the heavy pot together: "WE carry!" Type the Latin for "we carry" (from <span class="latin">portāre</span>).</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="port…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">"We" forms end in <b>-mus</b>.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q3c">
      <p class="qtext">3 · The parrot screeches <span class="latin">"laudant!"</span> Who is doing the praising?</p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">I</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">you (one person)</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">we</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">they</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>-nt</b> at the end means "they".</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q3d">
      <p class="qtext">4 · A note on the oven reads: <span class="latin">"Vocātis!"</span> What does it mean?</p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">you (one) call</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">you all call</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">we call</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">they call</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>-tis</b> means "you all" (plural you).</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q3e">
      <p class="qtext">5 · 🍲 Dessert round! The parrot acts out verbs with its wings. Tap each verb, then tap what it means.</p>
      <div class="matchgrid" data-game="m3">
        <div class="matchrow">
          <button class="mword" data-pair="love">amat</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="call">vocat</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="carry">portat</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="praise">laudat</button>
          <button class="mword" data-pair="sing">cantat</button>
