    <div class="keybanner" id="key3">The parrot spits out a shiny key! Third key: <span class="numeral">I</span></div>
    <div class="doorbox" id="door3">
      <p style="margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:700;">Feed the parrot all five answers to unlock the garden gate.</p>
      <button class="bigbtn" disabled onclick="goTo(4)">Open the gate →</button>
