        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">you have</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">we have</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">they have</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>-mus</b> = "we", in every conjugation.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q4d">
      <p class="qtext">4 · The last statue hands you the key and says: "YOU hold it now." Type the Latin for "you hold" (one person, from <span class="latin">tenēre</span>).</p>
      <div class="typein"><input type="text" aria-label="answer" placeholder="ten…"><button class="check">Check</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Stem <b>tene-</b> plus <b>-s</b> for "you" (singular).</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="keybanner" id="key4">The statues bow. The fourth key is yours: <span class="numeral">II</span></div>
    <div class="doorbox" id="door4">
      <p style="margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:700;">Answer all four statues to reach the Porta Magna.</p>
