  <!-- ROOM 5: PORTA MAGNA — finale -->
  <section class="screen card r5" id="s5">
    <p class="room-eyebrow">Fīnāle · Porta Magna</p>
    <h2>The Great Door</h2>
    <p class="story">The bronze doors tower over you. Two final inscriptions must be translated, and then the four numeral keys go into the lock — <b>in the order you found them</b>, written as ordinary digits.</p>

    <div class="q" id="q5a">
      <p class="qtext">1 · The left inscription: <span class="latin">"Puella aquam portat."</span></p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">The girls carry water.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">The girl carries the water.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">The water carries the girl.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">Carry the water, girl!</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>Puella</b> is the subject (nominative), <b>aquam</b> the object (-am, accusative), <b>portat</b> = he/she carries.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q5b">
      <p class="qtext">2 · The right inscription: <span class="latin">"Amīcī dōna vident."</span></p>
      <div class="choices">
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">The friend sees the gift.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">The gifts see the friends.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="1">The friends see the gifts.</button>
        <button class="choice" data-ok="0">We see our friends' gifts.</button>
      </div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext"><b>Amīcī</b> = friends (plural subject), <b>dōna</b> = gifts (neuter plural object), <b>vident</b> = they see.</div>
      <p class="feedback"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="q" id="q5c">
      <p class="qtext">3 · Now the lock. Enter your four numeral keys as digits, in the order you earned them (Ātrium → Bibliothēca → Culīna → Hortus).</p>
      <div class="final-code">
        <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="1" aria-label="digit 1">
        <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="1" aria-label="digit 2">
        <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="1" aria-label="digit 3">
        <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="1" aria-label="digit 4">
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;"><button class="check" id="codebtn">Turn the key</button></div>
      <button class="hintbtn">Need a hint?</button><div class="hinttext">Roman numerals: V = 5, III = 3, I = 1, II = 2. Your keys are shown at the top of the screen.</div>
      <p class="feedback" style="text-align:center;"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WIN -->
  <section class="screen" id="s6">
    <div class="cert">
      <svg class="owl-svg" viewBox="0 0 120 130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
