      <p class="time" id="finaltime"></p>
      <p style="color:#5c5570; line-height:1.6; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto;">
        You proved your mastery of 1st and 2nd declension nouns and 1st and 2nd conjugation verbs.
        The owl salutes you: <em>Bene fēcistī, discipula!</em>
